      "content": "Hey, I'm a high school history teacher and I'm looking over an essay a student wrote. The main thesis is that \"National identity is a necessary tool for social cohesion and should be prioritized over globalist integration.\" Can you help me critique the logic of this argument so I can give them some feedback?",
